  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Noah, a nameless stage actor, struggles to get by while living with her younger sibling.\n\nOne day, while rehearsing with the troupe as usual, Noah notices a man she’s never seen before.\n\nAssuming he’s a new member, Noah doesn’t think much of it—until she realizes that she’s the only one who can see the man.\n\nThe mysterious man hands Noah a string of prayer beads, and as soon as Noah touches them, she’s overwhelmed by unfamiliar memories.\n\nIn her confusion, she accidentally drops the beads.\nAs the beads scatter in all directions, the man utters an ominous phrase:\n\n“Baek Noah, you’re going to die soon.”\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bf_dream)",
